{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"prelim-2005-meet-science2-16","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2005,"subject":"chemistry","number":16,"points":null,"unitId":"lab","unitLabel":"실험·분석화학","topic":"적정·실험과정·화학적산소요구량","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["lab"],"stem":"화학적산소요구량은아래와같은실험과정을거쳐결정한다.\n(단, 실험과정에서주어진반응식은완결되어있지않다.)\n<실험과정>\n2－를넣어, 오염물질을\n(가) 오염된물에알고있는양의Cr2O7\n산화시킨다.\n2－→2Cr3＋＋산화된물질\n오염물질＋Cr2O7\n(나) 반응하고남은Cr2O7\n2－를Fe2＋로산화/환원적정하여\n2－의양을결정한다.\n오염물질과반응한Cr2O7\n2－＋6Fe2＋→2Cr3＋＋6Fe3＋\nCr2O7\n2－의양을산소의질량으로\n(다) 오염물질과반응한Cr2O7\n환산한다.\nO2 ＋4e－→2O2－\n(라) 오염된물에대한산소의질량비를ppm으로표시한다.\n2－0.0240 몰을넣고오염물을산화시켰\n오염된물1.00 L에Cr2O7\n2－을환원시키기위하여0.120 몰의Fe2＋가\n다. 남아있는Cr2O7\n소비되었다. 오염된물의화학적산소요구량은얼마인가?","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017","t018","t019","t020","t021","t022","t023","t024"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"192 ppm","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t025"]},{"number":2,"text":"320 ppm","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t026"]},{"number":3,"text":"384 ppm","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t027"]},{"number":4,"text":"576 ppm","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t028"]},{"number":5,"text":"704 ppm","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t029"]}],"answer":null,"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerStatus":"untranscribed","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":744,"height":629,"region":0,"bbox":[14.111,45.279,297.6,251.6],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017","t018","t019"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/prelim-2005-meet-science2-16/01.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":5,"sourceRect":[373.089,441.121,690.55,845.833],"width":317.462,"height":404.712,"items":[{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-01","bbox":[14.111,45.279,297.6,251.6],"section":"stem"},{"id":"t001","type":"text","text":"16. 화학적산소요구량은아래와같은실험과정을거쳐결정한다.","bbox":[5.0,5.0,307.379,11.032],"spans":[{"text":"16.","bbox":[5.0,5.0,12.99,11.